{'symbol': 'ALGN', 'date': '2022-05-20 16:00:00', 'title': 'ALIGN TECHNOLOGY AND ASANA ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO OFFER ASANA SMILES™ FOR ALIGN, A NEW WORK MANAGEMENT SOLUTION TO INVISALIGN TRAINED DOCTORS IN THE UNITED STATES', 'text': 'TEMPE, ARIZ.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALIGN TECHNOLOGY, INC. (“ALIGN”) (NASDAQ: ALGN) A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL DEVICE COMPANY THAT DESIGNS, MANUFACTURES, AND SELLS THE INVISALIGN SYSTEM OF CLEAR ALIGNERS, ITERO INTRAORAL SCANNERS, AND EXOCAD CAD/CAM SOFTWARE FOR DIGITAL ORTHODONTICS AND RESTORATIVE DENTISTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT WITH ASANA, INC. (NYSE: ASAN) (LTSE: ASAN), A LEADING WORK MANAGEMENT PLATFORM FOR TEAMS. THE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WILL OFFER INVISALIGN TRAINED DOCTORS IN THE U.S.'}